{"id": "0a87a031e804912db8df", "question": "Did Harry Houdini's wife make psychics look foolish?", "step_idx": 0, "options": ["A): Yes", "B): No"], "correct": "A", "initial_cot": "Harry Houdini, the famous magician, was known for his debunking of psychics and spiritualists. His wife, Bess Houdini, played a significant role in this endeavor. After Houdini's death, she held a series of s\u00e9ances, hoping to contact him. However, none of these s\u00e9ances produced any evidence of genuine psychic ability. In fact, many of them were exposed as fraudulent. So, in a way, yes, Bess Houdini did make psychics look foolish by publicly exposing fraudulent mediums. But it's important to note that not all psychics were targeted, and some were not discredited.", "initial_cot_probs": [1.2751875999583717e-07, 1.8140537019046242e-14], "initial_probs": [2.873659923352534e-07, 6.04168069197851e-14], "prediction": 0, "cot_prediction": 0, "cot_step": "Harry Houdini, the famous magician, was known for his debunking of psychics and spiritualists.", "segmented_cot": ["Harry Houdini, the famous magician, was known for his debunking of psychics and spiritualists.", "His wife, Bess Houdini, played a significant role in this endeavor.", "After Houdini's death, she held a series of s\u00e9ances, hoping to contact him.", "However, none of these s\u00e9ances produced any evidence of genuine psychic ability.", "In fact, many of them were exposed as fraudulent.", "So, in a way, yes, Bess Houdini did make psychics look foolish by publicly exposing fraudulent mediums.", "But it's important to note that not all psychics were targeted, and some were not discredited."], "unlearning_results": {"0": {"completion": "A): Yes. Harry Houdini's", "probs": [2.873659923352534e-07, 6.04168069197851e-14], "prediction": 0, "target_cot_step": "Harry Houdini, the famous magician, was known for his debunking of psychics and spiritualists.", "target_cot_step_prefix": "Human: Question: Did Harry Houdini's wife make ps